  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC in the RCRC Mental Health and Psychosocial Support (MHPSS) Movement Hub and Roadmap: Implementing the adopted MHPSS policy &amp; resolution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution enables ICRC to fully engage in transforming the IFRC Psychosocial Centre to a Movement wide MHPSS Hub with a shared and sustainable governance model. The Hub will bolster the impact of the Movement in providing access to MHPSS in varying types of crises worldwide, and strengthen Movement wide cooperation, complementarity and division of labor in general. 

This is a specific contribution in addition to the Netherlands  unearmarked support to the Movement, which is provided on the  understanding that the development and operationalization of the Hub requires enhanced efforts and involvement for which the ICRC and the Movement risk to lack resources, given the current accumulation of crises. This temporary addition ensures that ICRC expertise, linked to its mandate, will be well embedded in the set-up of the Hub. Moreover, it supports implementing the MHPSS Roadmap  until the 34th RCRC Conference, and consultations and work of the Hub in the year thereafter.</narrative>
  </description>
